  "details": "I don't know if anyone has had this issue recently.\n\nFor me, and a large number of my friends, whilst using a quest 3, if the instance is above 20 and/or the world is poorly optimised (after a micro lag spike) it will cut off your game audio and mic entirely until you turn your headset off and back on. \n\nIt also has an issue of occurring back-to-back after the first incident occurs. \n\nNote: it has happened both to users on and off open beta.",
